<title>SWITZERLAND: Swiss National Bank leaves discount rate unchanged.</title>
<headline>Swiss National Bank leaves discount rate unchanged.</headline>
<dateline>ZURICH 1996-10-31</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Swiss National Bank (SNB) said it left its discount rate unchanged at 1.00 percent after the latest weekly meeting of its three-member board.</p>
<p>The SNB was not expected to make any changes in its rates at today's meeting.</p>
<p>&quot;Everything remains the same,&quot; one SNB spokesman said.</p>
<p>The rate was last changed when the SNB cut it to 1.00 percent from 1.50 percent on September 26.</p>
<p>-- Zurich Editorial, +41 1 631 7340</p>
</text>
